## Phase 2 — Hydrogen Atom & Pairing

### Hydrogen Orbitals (3D)
- Implement spherical harmonics Yₗₘ(θ,φ)
- Full hydrogen wavefunctions ψₙₗₘ(r,θ,φ)
- Radial equation solver (Laguerre polynomials)
- Volume render s, p, d, f orbitals

### H₂ Molecule
- Two-center wavefunction in Born-Oppenheimer approximation
- Bonding orbital: ψ₊ = ψ₁ + ψ₂ (constructive interference)
- Antibonding orbital: ψ₋ = ψ₁ - ψ₂ (node between nuclei)
- Potential energy surface: E(R) as function of nuclear separation R
- Interactive nuclear separation slider

### Magnetic Effects on H₂
- Zeeman splitting: each orbital shifted by ±μB·B·mₗ
- Visualization of orbital symmetry breaking under field
- Paschen-Back regime at high B

